    "interpretation_witnesses": [
      {
        "end": 1907,
        "quote": "\nThe supplied JSON stores the individual simulated ratios; no summary statistic,\nuncertainty estimate or computed contrast is supplied.\n\nThe synthetic usable-batch model declares two resources within the same single\nbatch compartment and period. Resource 1 has 12 micromoles available; resource\n2 has 6 micromoles available. The declared model consumes one micromole of\neach resource per micromole of output and specifies 10 micromoles of output\ndemand. Within this toy model the declared resource list is complete, resources\ndo not regenerate and the declared quantities have no measurement spread.\nThese assumptions do not establish actual usable biological resources,\nphysiological capacity, steady-state flux or conditional reaction energetics.\n\nThe JSON and this protocol describe the same synthetic dataset. Reusing them\nor asking another question about them does not create an independent dataset.\nUnknown chemical identities, calibration and connection to the supplied protein\nremain unknown. The original reaction reader determines which supported\ncomponents can be calculated from these declared operands.\n",
        "representation": "original",
